('brlan','wet',5,{'occ':2}),('zhing','and',6,{'occ':4}),('gsher ba','flowing',5,{'occ':2}),('chu','water',5,{'occ':3}),('phor pa','glass',5,{'occ':3}),('gang po','full',5),('cha shas','parts',5),('gsum','three',5,{'occ':4}),('ldan','with',5,{'occ':3}),('du',None,6,{'cls':'case','nul':'Adverbial case after ldan; no separate English word beyond the possessive construction.'}),('skye ba','occurs',5)
],"The source's one skye ba is linked to the first occurs; the English reprise it occurs remains unwrapped. cig car du owns together; sit down is expansion. gzhi mthun pa is omitted because its common-locus relation is distributed through one thing which is simultaneously and its complements; it is not a null. nges par is omitted because its modal force is distributed with dgos in necessary. own position excludes supplied our. The second gang po has no separate fullness exponent; the other two fullness occurrences are linked.")
